        "id": 1,
        "description": "1. In this chapter, you will reach an area with two heavy blocks, with both anti-gravity and magnetic power consoles.\n2. The first thing you have to do is **activate the magnetic generator, then activate the anti-gravity but quickly disable it**.\n3. If done correctly, the left block should be on the ceiling and the right block on the floor.\n4. You can now finally **climb the platforms** to proceed to the next chapter.",
